    "output": "# Forge & Fable - Items\n\n\n## Healing Potion (healing_potion)\nCategory: item-category-consumable\nRarity: rarity-common\nRestores 50 HP\n\n\n## Iron Ingot (iron_ingot)\nCategory: item-category-crafting-resource\nRarity: rarity-common\nSmelted iron.\n\n\n## Iron Sword (iron_sword)\nCategory: item-category-weapon\nRarity: rarity-uncommon\nA sturdy, reliable blade\n\n\n## Leather Strip (leather_strip)\nCategory: item-category-crafting-resource\nRarity: rarity-common\n\n\n\n## Moonpetal Herb (moonpetal_herb)\nCategory: item-category-crafting-resource\nRarity: rarity-rare\n\n\n"
  },
